<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg to auction 5.50 pct 2007 series 3 bond.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg to auction 5.50 pct 2007 series 3 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Treasury said the following bond would be offered at its monthly auction -  Type of bond  linear  5.50 pct	 Due date 23/05/2007</p>
<p> Series nr 3				  Payment date 19/09</p>
<p> ISIN code LU-007639473-2		 Auction date 17/09</p>
<p>Common code  7639473 Accr.interest 116 days (30/360)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
